---
description: Frontend conventions
globs: frontend/src/**
alwaysApply: false
---

- TypeScript strict.
- No business rules in the UI (API is the source of truth).
- Show the exact rejection reason and remaining seconds returned by the API.
- TanStack Query for all API calls.
- Tailwind only.
- Role-based routes for the three roles.
- Ask before adding any library.
